#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:1 docs/sap/security-model.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP Security"
msgstr "SAP 安全"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:8
msgid ""
"Hub RPC requires a **service API token** on every WebSocket `connect`. SAP "
"attach still assumes a trusted client once transport auth succeeds."
msgstr ""
"Hub RPC 要求每次 WebSocket `connect` 携带**服务 API 令牌**。传输层认证成功"
"后，SAP attach 仍假定客户端可信。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trust boundary"
msgstr "信任边界"

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph trusted [Trusted client with service token]\n"
"    Hub[\"Hub anima service :2658\"]\n"
"    RpcEndpoint[\"/hub/rpc/v1 WebSocket\"]\n"
"    Bundled[Bundled SPA modules]\n"
"    SatA[Satellite companion]\n"
"    SatB[Satellite pair-programming]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Browser[Browser]\n"
"  Browser --> Bundled\n"
"  Browser --> SatA\n"
"  Bundled -->|\"HubRPC connect + auth_token\"| RpcEndpoint\n"
"  SatA -->|\"HubRPC + sap.attach\"| RpcEndpoint\n"
"  SatB --> RpcEndpoint\n"
"  RpcEndpoint --> Hub\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph trusted [Trusted client with service token]\n"
"    Hub[\"Hub anima service :2658\"]\n"
"    RpcEndpoint[\"/hub/rpc/v1 WebSocket\"]\n"
"    Bundled[Bundled SPA modules]\n"
"    SatA[Satellite companion]\n"
"    SatB[Satellite pair-programming]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Browser[Browser]\n"
"  Browser --> Bundled\n"
"  Browser --> SatA\n"
"  Bundled -->|\"HubRPC connect + auth_token\"| RpcEndpoint\n"
"  SatA -->|\"HubRPC + sap.attach\"| RpcEndpoint\n"
"  SatB --> RpcEndpoint\n"
"  RpcEndpoint --> Hub\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Current controls"
msgstr "现有控制"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Control                       | Status                                                 |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| TLS on Hub RPC                | Optional; remote access via Tunnel + HTTPS/WSS         |\n"
"| Token on Hub RPC `connect`    | **Yes** — service API token (`verifyServiceApiToken`)  |\n"
"| Origin check on WebSocket     | **None**                                               |\n"
"| SAP attach for instance scope | **Yes** — `tool.*` requires `sap.attach`               |\n"
"| Session-scoped tool routing   | **Yes** — [strict routing](tools.md)                   |\n"
"| Credential values in frames   | **No** — credentials stay in pass; LLM sees paths only |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 控制项                          | 状态                                                   |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Hub RPC 上的 TLS                | 可选；通过 Tunnel + HTTPS/WSS 远程访问                 |\n"
"| Hub RPC `connect` 上的 Token    | **有** — 服务 API 令牌（`verifyServiceApiToken`）      |\n"
"| WebSocket Origin 检查           | **无**                                                 |\n"
"| 实例范围的 SAP attach           | **有** — `tool.*` 需要 `sap.attach`                    |\n"
"| 会话范围的工具路由              | **有** — [严格路由](tools.md)                          |\n"
"| 帧中的凭证值                    | **无** — 凭证保留在 pass 中；LLM 仅见路径              |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:41
msgid ""
"Any client that holds a valid service token and can reach `ws://"
"127.0.0.1:2658/hub/rpc/v1` can:"
msgstr ""
"任何持有有效服务令牌且能访问 `ws://127.0.0.1:2658/hub/rpc/v1` 的客户端都可"
"以："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:44
msgid ""
"Call bundled RPC methods (chat, tasks, notifications, …) without `sap.attach`"
msgstr ""
"在不调用 `sap.attach` 的情况下调用壳内 bundled RPC 方法（聊天、任务、通知等）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:44
msgid ""
"After `sap.attach`, register tools as the attached `app_id` / `instance_id`"
msgstr "`sap.attach` 后，以已 attach 的 `app_id` / `instance_id` 注册工具"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:46
msgid ""
"Operational guidance: bind Hub to loopback; rotate service tokens; do not "
"expose port 2658 to untrusted networks without Tunnel + Access. See "
"[security guide](../guide/security.md)."
msgstr ""
"运维建议：将 Hub 绑定到 loopback；轮换服务令牌；在未使用 Tunnel + Access 的情"
"况下，不要将 2658 端口暴露给不可信网络。参见 [安全指南](../guide/"
"security.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Protocol hardening (transport layer)"
msgstr "协议加固（传输层）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:50
msgid ""
"Invalid frames close the socket with **1003**. Protocol violations (double "
"connect, RPC before connect, `tool.*` without attach) close with **1008**. "
"Failed auth closes with **1008** (`unauthorized`)."
msgstr ""
"无效帧会以 **1003** 关闭套接字。协议违规（重复 connect、connect 前 RPC、未 "
"attach 时调用 `tool.*`）会以 **1008** 关闭。认证失败以 **1008**"
"（`unauthorized`）关闭。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Future directions (not implemented)"
msgstr "未来方向（未实现）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:54
msgid "Possible hardening items — track via GitHub Issues if prioritized:"
msgstr "可能的加固项 — 若优先处理则通过 GitHub Issues 跟踪："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:58
msgid "mTLS on `/hub/rpc/v1`"
msgstr "`/hub/rpc/v1` 上的 mTLS"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:58
msgid "Instance attestation tied to managed satellite systemd units"
msgstr "与托管 satellite systemd 单元绑定的实例证明"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:58
msgid "Rate limits on connect and `tool.register`"
msgstr "对 connect 和 `tool.register` 的速率限制"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:58
msgid "Explicit disconnect on missed heartbeats"
msgstr "心跳丢失时显式断开连接"
